.TH FBPRINTSCREEN 1 "2026-09-10" "flux-tools 2.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
fbprintscreen \- take and display screenshots
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fbprintscreen
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B fbprintscreen
captures a screenshot using scrot and saves it to the XDG pictures directory, falling back to ~/Pictures. It opens a preview with gpicview or feh when available. The feh preview uses 2/3 of the screen size when display geometry is available.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/Pictures
Fallback directory used when the XDG pictures directory is unavailable
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR scrot (1),
.BR feh (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Tomas-M <https://github.com/Tomas-M>
crims0n <crims0n@minios.dev>
.SH NOTES
The pictures directory follows xdg-user-dir when available, falling back to ~/Pictures. Paths containing spaces are supported. Failed captures remove partial images. Preview uses gpicview or feh when available.
